column54:
Great opportunity to own a condo in the Arbor Woods complex! Two-bedroom, three-bath unit with a finished lower level;
sliding glass doors from dining room to covered deck; full bath and walk-in closet off primary bedroom; lower level features a family room with built-in-shelves, a walkout to a patio, full bath and plenty of storage; additional room in basement could be a study; close proximity to I-74. Detached garage (#94) ** This property is being sold "as is" as part of an estate and in need of cosmetics such as new flooring and paint, but is priced accordingly.
**First floor unit with security entrance and elevator; all appliances included, but not warranted
